      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
